# Dataset

This project uses the **Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist**.

## Source
- **Platform:** Kaggle
- **Link:** [Download Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce)

## Files Used
| File Name | Description |
|---|---|
| olist_orders_dataset.csv | Order information |
| olist_order_items_dataset.csv | Items purchased in each order |
| olist_customers_dataset.csv | Customer details |
| olist_sellers_dataset.csv | Seller information |
| olist_products_dataset.csv | Product details |
| olist_order_payments_dataset.csv | Payment information |
| olist_order_reviews_dataset.csv | Customer reviews |

## Note
> The dataset files are not included in this repository due to size limitations.
> Please download directly from Kaggle using the link above.
